WEBVTT

00:13:58.453 --> 00:14:01.049
so that he will be able to face the world

00:14:01.049 --> 00:14:03.169
once he gets released?

00:14:03.169 --> 00:14:07.633
Surely, that would be in the interest of all of us.

00:14:09.549 --> 00:14:12.800
(Applause)

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:16.802
Thank you. (Applause)